{"unit_id":"blueziii__dsh-mc-agent#card-zh","repo":"blueziii/dsh-mc-agent","commit":"af7ea21d203e3d975b3e7a99152a35561e813e1a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mc-agent 是一款 DSH Web 插件，让 AI 以 Minecraft Java 版玩家身份进入服务器。它将原生 mc_* 工具注册到 DSH 会话，并提供观察、移动、挖掘、战斗、采集、放置、合成、熔炼、箱子存取和农场等操作；还支持自动任务、会话事件通知、账户管理与游戏记忆。用户可通过 MC 模式限制会话工具范围，也可选 MC+ 模式保留标准工具。适合希望用自然语言操控 Minecraft 角色、完成探索与生存任务的 DSH 用户。需要 Minecraft 服务器与可用账号；皮肤查询功能会访问 Mojang 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3174","index.js:3509","extensions/mc_auto.mjs:1","extensions/mc_craft.mjs:1145","extensions/mc_furnace.mjs:396","presets/minecraft.patch.yml:1"]}
{"unit_id":"blueziii__dsh-mc-agent#card-en","repo":"blueziii/dsh-mc-agent","commit":"af7ea21d203e3d975b3e7a99152a35561e813e1a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-mc-agent is a DSH Web plugin for Minecraft Java. Its native tools let an AI observe, move, mine, fight, build, craft, smelt, farm, and run tasks, with session events and game memory. MC mode limits tools; MC+ retains standard tools. Requires a server and account; skin lookup uses Mojang.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:3174","index.js:3509","extensions/mc_auto.mjs:1","extensions/mc_craft.mjs:1145","extensions/mc_furnace.mjs:396","presets/minecraft.patch.yml:1"]}
